[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8100.32, "timestamp": "02:15:00", "text": "仅限商务和俱乐部活动。 另一个子程序我不知道，呃，我用它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8103.76, "timestamp": "02:15:03", "text": "另一个子程序我不知道，呃，我用它 一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8116.51, "timestamp": "02:15:16", "text": "呃，关于这个的任何私信。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8119.31, "timestamp": "02:15:19", "text": "天哪，我的私信是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8122.95, "timestamp": "02:15:22", "text": "关闭。实际上，它基本上是关闭的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8125.83, "timestamp": "02:15:25", "text": "除非并且直到它像一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8128.39, "timestamp": "02:15:28", "text": "你们拥有的那种合作方式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8130.189, "timestamp": "02:15:30", "text": "到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8132.629, "timestamp": "02:15:32", "text": "嗯，只是想结交新朋友。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8134.87, "timestamp": "02:15:34", "text": "啊，我明白了。我懂了。嘿，那是一辆车。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8143.109, "timestamp": "02:15:43", "text": "相信是因为现在我尝试了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8145.589, "timestamp": "02:15:45", "text": "在与人交往方面有过一些不愉快的经历"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8149.03, "timestamp": "02:15:49", "text": "过去。所以，我基本上算是严格意义上的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8151.669, "timestamp": "02:15:51", "text": "目前限制了 Discord 的私信功能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8152.99, "timestamp": "02:15:52", "text": "以及其他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8155.149, "timestamp": "02:15:55", "text": "社交。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8159.189, "timestamp": "02:15:59", "text": "是的。嗯。我觉得你也应该如此"}]